Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.68,0:22:21.86,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)\an9\fs15}狙いさだめた  指先がさす
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.88,0:22:24.23,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)\an9\fs15}運命は絶望?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.25,0:22:26.83,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)\an9\fs15}それとも希望?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.16,0:22:33.28,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}ゆらぎの中で  受信してゆく
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.30,0:22:35.42,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}悲しみにも負けない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.44,0:22:38.11,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}勇気だけをください
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.58,0:22:44.36,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}大切なもの  守るため
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.43,0:22:49.77,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}「強さ」はあると信じてる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.79,0:22:55.63,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Saving our future　一緒に
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.90,0:22:58.79,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}明日へのドア開いた空へ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.80,0:23:01.25,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}飛び立とう
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.40,0:23:07.11,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}とある世界の果てで
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.22,0:23:12.87,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}駆け抜けてく　Real Force
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.05,0:23:20.49,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}光を放って!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.68,0:22:21.86,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)\fs20\an9}那命中注定的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.88,0:22:24.23,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)\fs20\an9}是絕望?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.25,0:22:26.83,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)\fs20\an9}還是希望?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.16,0:22:33.28,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}在搖擺中 發送著信息
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.30,0:22:35.42,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}請賜予我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.44,0:22:38.11,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}不會向悲傷低頭的勇氣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.58,0:22:44.36,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}為了保護珍貴的事物
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.43,0:22:49.77,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}我相信自己的堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.79,0:22:55.63,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Saving our future  讓我們一同
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.90,0:22:58.79,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}敞開明天的門  向開闊的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.80,0:23:01.25,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}展翅高飛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.40,0:23:07.11,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}向那世界的彼端
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.22,0:23:12.87,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}飛馳而去 Real Force
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.05,0:23:20.49,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}散發出光芒!
